			<item>
				<title>No Sad, Only Zoom-zoom Smiles</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/aetherway/special/no-sad/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 14 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/aetherway/special/no-sad/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/no-scanlines-1080.webp&#34; alt=&#34;No sad, only zoom-zoom smiles (T-Shirt)&#34;&gt; &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/images/no-sad-text.png&#34; alt=&#34;No sad, only zoom-zoom smiles (Only text)&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/abdoopts/001/&#34;&gt;Millennium Whoop&lt;/a&gt;, the iconic DJ of &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/space-dvd/&#34;&gt;Space DVD&lt;/a&gt;, is adored by fans across the &lt;em&gt;Aetherway&lt;/em&gt;. She is known for her love of &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/aetherway/abdoopts/003/&#34;&gt;Madame Astra’s&lt;/a&gt; Nebula Cupcakes&lt;/em&gt; and her dream of becoming &lt;em&gt;President of the Galaxy&lt;/em&gt;. Her fanbase is growing so fast that one planet even ran out of resources while producing her merch. Her catchphrase, &lt;em&gt;“No sad, only zoom-zoom smiles,”&lt;/em&gt; has reached mantra status in &lt;em&gt;Interdimensional Speech&lt;/em&gt; and likely means “no sadness, only in-between smiles.”&lt;/p&gt;</description>
